ass=\"reference-text\">Cf. \u0393. 1003<sup>a</sup> 33 and \u0396. 1.</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-2\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-2\">\u2191</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">1045<sup>b</sup> 36 read <i>\u03c7\u03c1\u03b7\u03c3\u03b9\u03bc\u03c9\u03c4\u03ac\u03c4\u03b7</i>.</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-3\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-3\">\u2191</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">Cf. \u0398. 1048<sup>a</sup> 27.</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-4\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-4\">\u2191</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">Cf. \u0394. 12.</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-5\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-5\">\u2191</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">1046<sup>a</sup> 7 read colon after <i>\u03b3\u03b5\u03c9\u03bc\u03b5\u03c4\u03c1\u03af\u03b1</i>. Cf. \u0394. 1019<sup>b</sup> 22-33 and note.</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-6\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-6\">\u2191</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">i.e. the event would not happen if the passive factor were different. What is oily cannot necessarily be crushed, nor what is yielding burnt.</span>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nParsed by mw\u2010api\u2010ext.eqiad.main\u20106d9575b685\u2010ldx8q\nCached time: 20260831082307\nCache expiry: 2592000\nCache expiry source: Module:Header (os.date(%Y))\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary\u2010page\u2010id, vary\u2010revision\u2010sha1]\nCPU time usage: 0.087 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.168 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 629/1000000\nRevision size: 546/2097152 bytes\nPost\u2010expand include size: 20502/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 7228/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 9/100\nExpensive parser function count: 2/500\nUnstrip recursion depth: 1/20\nUnstrip post\u2010expand size: 15617/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.034/10.000 seconds\nLua memo